s": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "main_page", "name": "主画面"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.020200000108161476, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.012200000128359534, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_hash": "sha256:ce3566a2e86861dee04c582d1d4dad654a742142313bf5d3719061431091fb1e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7549, "output_tokens": 95, "latency_ms": 1744.098899999699, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先查一下现有的页面和点位信息。", "reasoning": "好的，用户想要把主画面的\"泵1\"绑到\"马达3\"上。我需要先查看一下当前有哪些页面和点，才能进行后续操作。\n\n让我先查看现有页面和点。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7729, "output_tokens": 472, "latency_ms": 6196.469399999842, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，我查到了以下信息：\n\n**页面情况：** 已有一个\"主画面\"（ID: `main_page`）\n**点位情况：** 目前还没有任何SCADA点（tags）\n\n在操作之前，我需要跟您确认几个细节：\n\n1. **\"马达3\"** 是一个SCADA点位吗？如果是，它是什么类型？\n   - 模拟量（analog）—— 如转速、电流等\n   - 数字量（digital）—— 如启停状态\n\n2. **\"泵1\"** 在主画面上是否已经存在？还是需要我新建一个泵的 widget？\n\n3. 您希望将泵绑定到马达3的哪个属性？比如：\n   - `value`（数值/状态显示）\n   - `color`（根据状态变色）\n   - 或其他属性？\n\n请提供更多信息，我好帮您完成配置。", "reasoning": "现在的情况是：\n1. 有一个页面叫\"主画面\"（ID: main_page）\n2. 但没有任何点位（points）存在\n\n用户说\"把主画面的泵1绑到马达3上\" - 这看起来是要把一个泵的widget绑定到一个马达的点位。但我们需要先搞清楚：\n\n1. \"泵1\" - 可能是一个widget（pump类型的widget），在主画面上\n2. \"马达3\" - 可能是一个SCADA点（tag），但目前没有任何点存在\n\n让我先看看主画面上有哪些widget，确认一下泵1是否存在。不过，并没有直接列出widget的工具... 我可以先看看页面上是否有widget。\n\n实际上，由于没有list_widgets工具，我可能需要先确认用户的需求细节。\n\n等等，用户的意图可能是：\n1. 创建一个名为\"马达3\"的点位（analog或digital类型）\n2. 在主画面上创建一个泵的widget（如果还没有的话），或者查找现有的泵widget\n3. 将泵widget绑定到马达3的点位\n\n但信息不足，我需要先问清楚用户：\n1. \"马达3\"是什么类型的点？是模拟量还是数字量？\n2. \"泵1\"是否已经在主画面上存在？还是需要新建？\n3. 绑定的属性是什么（比如泵的运行状态、转速等）？\n\n让我先问问用户获取更多信息。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15278, "output_tokens": 567, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 7971.747499999765}, "judge": null}
