随时告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "报警创建成功了。让我总结一下给用户。现在完成了当前任务，可以转到DONE状态。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 23439, "output_tokens": 582, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 7862.800100000641}, "judge": null}
