"action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "PI-201", "type": "analog", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "valve1", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.02409999979136046, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_scripts", "action": "list_scripts", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "scripts": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.013299999409355223, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_hash": "sha256:d88107776650cb454d9d573d07babb192ac66fb7faa1784b2aff648b26102014", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7562, "output_tokens": 186, "latency_ms": 2874.0324999998847, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我先查看一下当前项目中的点位和脚本情况，以便更好地为您配置。", "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个全局脚本，使用OnEvent触发器。脚本逻辑是：如果PI-201过高，则将valve1置位。\n\n让我先理清需求：\n1. 需要创建一个脚本，触发类型为\"on_event\"\n2. 脚本逻辑：如果PI-201过高，则把valve1置位\n\n等等，这里的\"PI-201\"可能是一个点（模拟量点），\"valve1\"可能是一个数字量点（阀门）。但我不确定这些点是否已经存在。让我先查看一下当前项目中已有的点、脚本等信息。\n\n先查一下现有的点和脚本吧。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7887, "output_tokens": 448, "latency_ms": 6443.958400000156, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的！项目中已存在两个点位：\n\n| 点位 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| **PI-201** | 模拟量 (analog) | 压力/过程值 |\n| **valve1** | 数字量 (digital) | 阀门（0/1） |\n\n我还需要确认一个细节：**PI-201 的 \"过高\" 阈值是多少？** 也就是说，当 PI-201 的值超过多少时，需要将 valve1 置位（设为 1/ON）？", "reasoning": "很好！项目中已经存在两个点：\n1. **PI-201** - 模拟量点（analog）\n2. **valve1** - 数字量点（digital）\n\n现在需要创建一个 on_event 触发的脚本，逻辑是：如果 PI-201 过高，则把 valve1 置位（set to true/1）。\n\n我需要先创建这个脚本。不过脚本的 body 需要写具体逻辑。对于\"PI-201过高\"这个条件，我需要一个合理的阈值。用户没有明确说阈值是多少，但我可以先按一个典型值来处理，或者先询问用户。\n\n等等，用户说\"PI-201过高\"，但没有给出具体阈值。我最好先问一下用户具体的阈值是多少，但也可以先按常规值（比如 100）来写，看看用户是否满意。\n\n不过作为助手，我应该在信息不足时向用户确认。但用户的需求比较明确，我可以先创建脚本，然后在 body 中写条件判断逻辑。\n\n让我先创建一个 on_event 脚本。对于 body，我会写类似的条件判断逻辑。\n\n脚本的 body 应该是什么语言？工具没有说明脚本语言，但按照 SCADA 脚本的常规写法，我可以用伪代码或者类似的方式。\n\n让我先创建脚本，body写一个简单的条件判断：\n\n```\nif PI-201 > 100 then\n    valve1 = 1\nendif\n```\n\n不过，我应该先问用户阈值，因为\"过高\"是一个模糊概念。\n\n或者，我先创建脚本结构，body留空，然后让用户确认具体阈值。\n\n算了，我先问用户PI-201的阈值是多少比较合适。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15449, "output_tokens": 634, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9348.173000000315}, "judge": null}
