理的条件判断逻辑。\n\n但首先，我需要知道\"过高\"的具体数值。让我问问用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15614, "output_tokens": 743, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 10186.96909999926}, "judge": null}
