 "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.018400000044493936, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "WS1_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "WS2_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.018600000657897908, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7568, "output_tokens": 123, "latency_ms": 1793.839900000421, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的！我来先查一下现有页面和点位信息，了解当前项目状态。", "reasoning": "用户想要：\n1. 复制车间一的页面到车间二\n2. 替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\n3. 做下装前校验\n\n首先，我需要查看当前有哪些页面，以及点位信息，以便了解情况。\n\n让我先列出所有页面和点位。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7846, "output_tokens": 679, "latency_ms": 7850.664399999914, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "好的，当前项目状态如下：\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| **现有页面** | 1 个：`ws1`（车间一） |\n| **现有点位** | `WS1_Status`（digital）、`WS2_Status`（digital） |\n\n目前遇到两个问题需要向您确认：\n\n---\n\n**问题 1：无法直接\"复制页面\"**\n\n当前工具没有提供一键复制页面的功能。我需要知道**车间一页面（ws1）上具体有哪些部件（widgets）、它们的布局、绑定点位等信息**，然后手动在新建的车间二页面上重建，并将绑定的 `WS1` 标签替换为 `WS2`。\n\n请问您能否告诉我车间一页面上的内容，比如：\n- 放了哪些部件（如 thermometer、tank、pump 等）？\n- 每个部件绑定了哪些点位属性？\n- 有哪些文本标签（如标题）需要替换文字内容？\n\n**问题 2：点位替换的规则**\n\n车间一页面中可能绑定了 `WS1_Status` 这个数字量点位。替换规则是：\n- `WS1_Status` → `WS2_Status`（因为已存在 `WS2_Status` 点位）\n- 是否还有其他含 `WS1` 的标签需要一并替换？\n\n请您提供车间一页面的详细内容，我就可以：\n1. 创建 **车间二** 页面\n2. 重建所有部件，将点位绑定从 `WS1` 替换为 `WS2`\n3. 进行 **项目校验（validate_project）** 做下装前检查", "reasoning": "好的，目前的情况：\n\n1. 只有1个页面：`ws1`，名称为\"车间一\"\n2. 有两个点位：`WS1_Status` (digital) 和 `WS2_Status` (digital)\n\n用户想复制车间一的页面到车间二，并替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'。\n\n但是目前工具中没有\"复制页面\"的功能。我能做的是：\n1. 查看车间一页面上的所有内容（但也没有查看页面内容的工具...）\n2. 实际上我们没有一个可以直接复制页面的工具。\n\n让我想想可用的工具：有 `create_page` 可以创建新页面，`create_widget` 可以创建部件，`create_rect`、`create_circle`、`create_line`、`create_text` 可以创建图形元素，还有 `bind_point` 可以绑定点位。\n\n但没有查询页面上有哪些部件的工具。没有类似于\"list_widgets\"或\"get_page_details\"的工具。\n\n所以问题在于：\n1. 我没有办法获取现有页面上的部件列表和绑定信息\n2. 也没有直接\"复制页面\"的工具\n\n因此，我需要向用户确认更多信息，因为无法直接查看页面上的具体内容。\n\n不过等等，让我想想有没有其他方式。用户说\"复制车间一的页面到车间二\"，但工具里没有复制功能。我可以用 `create_page` 创建一个新页面（车间二），但不知道上面有什么部件。\n\n我需要向用户说明情况，询问车间一页面上具体有哪些部件和点位绑定，或者让他们提供更多细节。\n\n让我先问用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15414, "output_tokens": 802, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 9675.726400000713}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "0aad6e1d-71b2-4fbc-ab64-a61093326154", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:54c5f9bfdd86c7d1683f6b962ec13a3d0363206585b7b9363a04535f610222b3", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-029", "text": "复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:47:47.696Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:47:56.984Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:47:47.696Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:47:56.984Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.01700000029813964, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "WS1_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "WS2_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.01990000055229757, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_h