{"trace_id": "a10c3470-c94e-46de-93ae-ace7546fe388", "experiment": {"config_name": "A_flat_baseline", "config_hash": "sha256:54c5f9bfdd86c7d1683f6b962ec13a3d0363206585b7b9363a04535f610222b3", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-050", "text": "把那个图元往右挪一点", "complexity": "simple", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:02.064Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:08.621Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:02.064Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T04:51:08.621Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "create_analog_alarm"}, {"name": "create_digital_alarm"}, {"name": "set_threshold"}, {"name": "enable_alarm"}, {"name": "disable_alarm"}, {"name": "delete_alarm"}, {"name": "create_point"}, {"name": "update_point"}, {"name": "delete_point"}, {"name": "list_points"}, {"name": "create_page"}, {"name": "rename_page"}, {"name": "delete_page"}, {"name": "create_widget"}, {"name": "bind_point"}, {"name": "list_pages"}, {"name": "create_rect"}, {"name": "create_circle"}, {"name": "create_line"}, {"name": "create_text"}, {"name": "apply_flow_layout"}, {"name": "group_widgets"}, {"name": "set_widget_style"}, {"name": "delete_widget"}, {"name": "enable_history"}, {"name": "disable_history"}, {"name": "set_retention"}, {"name": "query_history"}, {"name": "list_history"}, {"name": "create_script"}, {"name": "update_script_body"}, {"name": "enable_script"}, {"name": "disable_script"}, {"name": "delete_script"}, {"name": "list_scripts"}, {"name": "validate_project"}, {"name": "deploy_project"}, {"name": "rollback_deployment"}, {"name": "show_deployment_status"}], "visible_count": 39, "selected": "list_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "pages": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.017800000023271423, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7547, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 4344.024099999842, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "目前系统中没有直接的\"移动图元\"工具，但有几种间接方式可以调整图元的位置。不过在此之前，我需要先确认一下具体信息。让我先看看当前有哪些页面和图元。", "reasoning": "用户想要把某个图元（widget）往右移动。但用户没有说明是哪个页面、哪个图元，也没有说要移动多少距离。\n\n我需要先问问用户具体信息：\n1. 哪个页面（page）？\n2. 哪个图元（widget id）？\n3. 往右移动多少像素？\n\n或者，我可以先查一下现有的页面列表，看看有哪些页面。\n\n让我先查一下页面列表，看看能不能帮用户确认。\n\n等等，用户说\"那个图元\"，可能是在我之前已经操作过的上下文中。但当前没有历史上下文可参考，所以我需要向用户询问更多信息。\n\n不过，我也可以先查一下现有的页面和widgets，让用户确认。\n\n实际上，移动图元位置并没有一个直接的\"move_widget\"工具。但是可以通过 `set_widget_style` 来修改位置？不对，set_widget_style 是修改样式的。\n\n或者我可以删除重建？但这不太对。\n\n实际上，没有直接的\"移动图元\"工具。图元的位置是在创建时通过 `position` 设置的。如果要移动，可能需要删除重建。\n\n等等，查看工具列表，没有直接移动widget的工具。但有一个 `apply_flow_layout` 可以重新排列位置。\n\n或者，也许我该先问用户具体情况。\n\n让我先查看当前的页面和widgets，然后向用户询问更多信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "input_tokens": 7932, "output_tokens": 181, "latency_ms": 2182.5079999998707, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前系统中还没有任何页面和图元。关于您提到的移动操作，我需要向您确认几个信息：\n\n1. **哪个页面？** — 您想操作的图元在哪个页面上？\n2. **哪个图元？** — 该图元的 ID 是什么？\n3. **往右移动多少？** — 需要移动多少个像素？\n\n另外提醒一下，系统中没有直接的\"移动图元\"工具，但您可以通过以下方式实现位置调整：\n- **重新创建 + 删除**：删除原图元，在新位置重新创建。\n- **使用 `apply_flow_layout`**：如果该图元与其他图元一起排列，可以通过流式布局调整位置。\n\n请提供上述信息，我来帮您处理！", "reasoning": "目前没有页面，也没有图元。所以用户说的\"那个图元\"我不知道是哪个。我需要向用户询问更多信息。"}], "rag": {"enabled": false, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 12, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": false, "selected_workflow": null}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15479, "output_tokens": 529, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 6557.6067000001785}, "judge": null}
